Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）糟了 迟到了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛不叫我起来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）因为没意义。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.81,0:00:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没意义也叫一下啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）我先走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛痛痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃、璃绪小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）哎呀～
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}擦伤了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.51,0:00:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 谢谢您！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:00:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男君。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）怎么了？\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感觉他心不在焉喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.21,0:01:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这难道是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.28,0:01:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.47,0:01:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）就是平时那个……对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，既然对璃绪小姐那么喜欢的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干脆下定决心去进攻一下不就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进攻？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，万一被甩了的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）而且璃绪小姐可是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个鲨鱼的妹妹哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）粉丝虽然很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但大家都害怕鲨鱼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.31,0:01:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不敢去进攻。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.63,0:01:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实是这么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才没有那种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.91,0:01:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重要的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼此的心意吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.17,0:01:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得对啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 搞不好的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能会被鲨鱼打得落花流水。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.59,0:01:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）反过来说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.54,0:01:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能获得鲨鱼的认可不就行了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.27,0:01:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）获得认可要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）对啊 要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在决斗中赢他之类的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.44,0:02:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）只要我在决斗中打败鲨鱼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((凌牙：能托付璃绪的只有你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.55,0:02:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男同学
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪～！))
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～！　马上就和鲨鱼决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下　铁男
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等　等一下啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）他听不见呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙　要和我？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对　对啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.37,0:02:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要是　在决斗中赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:03:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个…　璃绪小姐的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说白了　你还不够格。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至少　你得达到游马的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}否则　你就死心吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的等级？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的话　就行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君的话　就行？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么就行啊里表？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也就是说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((婚礼啊　我！))
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…　那不就只有游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪的恋人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只认游马你是说这个吗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.09,0:05:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 这两个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 确实 挺般配的呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说他们在交往。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 你听说了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.81,0:05:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.77,0:05:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那两个人 好像在交往哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼他 把游马君
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.57,0:05:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}认作璃绪的恋人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这可是 震撼心园学园的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.18,0:05:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大新闻里！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于 超人气情侣诞生了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿 嘿嘿～ 这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜～ 不可原谅喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊？铁男把我叫到这种地方来。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我老实说，很不甘心！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不甘心什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，那个人不是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我不行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，我干脆退出！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，我啊，一直把你当成挚友。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，哦，谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.59,0:06:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为这样，我才要把她托付给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是敢让璃绪哭的话我可不饶你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊！？你这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼觉得璃绪适合的人他认可的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，就是你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）这样啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.03,0:06:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来是这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.81,0:06:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）璃绪小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消息来源是凌牙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.37,0:06:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛？突然把我叫出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要向你发起决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又来啊……你还真是经常被人挑战呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也差不多忍无可忍了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？那是什么意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就因为你是哥哥什么都自作主张！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐，那、那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:06:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能稍微安静一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，好的……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊透顶！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）你要逃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.53,0:07:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亏你还自称鲨鱼，真让人无语。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明其实讨厌吃洋葱。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且青椒也是每次都剩下不吃。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住口！竟敢愚弄兄长好大的胆子。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！这样一来 兄妹吵架决斗就是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第100场了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.75,0:07:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反杀你哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（众人）第100次兄妹吵架决斗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.81,0:07:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼和他妹妹的决斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.99,0:07:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）D视镜 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻是我。 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.57,0:07:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 大颚鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌特殊召唤 鲨鱼踢球手。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼踢球手）踢球～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我将等级3的大颚鲨和
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼踢球手 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.87,0:08:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}浮上来吧潜航母舰 航空鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是鲨鱼！第一回合就
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.47,0:08:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把超量召唤给打出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动航空鲨的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有一张自己的手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给予400点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼的手牌是4张！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一上来就是1600的伤害！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看我把你那嚣张气焰打下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空气鱼雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:08:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）我从手牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤守卫企鹅。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.63,0:09:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）这张卡在对方怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果造成伤害发生时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.73,0:09:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个伤害无效并特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}躲开了鲨鱼的先制攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是浦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.90,0:09:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐 太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 这种程度的事做到是理所当然的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我又不是想被人夸奖。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.89,0:09:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水之闸门！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 每有一张自己的魔法陷阱区的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖牌就一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手一只怪兽的攻击无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖两张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 这样一来我就能防住两次攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 就让你见识一下吧。我的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.45,0:09:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 暴风雪猎鹰。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级4的守卫企鹅和
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暴风雪猎鹰进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.83,0:10:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.81,0:10:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 零鸟兽 西尔菲涅。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐 由于水之门的效果攻击无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.36,0:10:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为这点程度我就应付不了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动西尔菲涅的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.82,0:10:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到下次我的回合开始时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.05,0:10:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将西尔菲涅以外的表侧表示
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡的效果无效。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.89,0:10:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完美冻结。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地被冻结了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 就无法用水之门进行防御了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.39,0:10:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挺能干的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，因这个效果被无效的每1张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方1只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.15,0:11:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降300点。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.22,0:11:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果被无效的是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空气鲨和碧水之门这2张。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此空气鲨的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.84,0:11:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降600点。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.81,0:11:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好样的，璃绪小姐。一口气上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《璃绪：凌牙不可能会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘记西尔菲涅的效果》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《难道说碧水之门是假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.59,0:11:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的主力是那张盖牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此……》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动装备魔法 沉默之翼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备给西尔菲涅。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡让装备怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升300点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，对方的魔法·陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不再受到效果影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.57,0:11:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，用那张盖牌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就没办法瞄准西尔菲涅了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观察得很仔细。但是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}撕裂天空吧，西尔菲涅！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击空气鲨。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.33,0:11:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冰之射线！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶！璃绪小姐，完美！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没中你的陷阱，真是可惜呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.57,0:12:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实可惜。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你的决斗实在太如我所料了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动。幽灵船队打捞。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在水属性怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.11,0:12:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被战斗破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将效果无效，把那1只怪兽超量以及{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为召唤素材的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最多2只特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.15,0:12:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把大颚鲨、鲨鱼·射手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有空气鲨特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气变成3只怪兽了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.33,0:12:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是怪兽效果被无效了的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要发动陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全装甲超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡即使在对方回合
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也能进行超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级3的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.19,0:12:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·射手和大颚鲨进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}撕裂漆黑之暗，现身吧黑鳍枪兵。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，根据全装甲超量的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将空气鲨装备给黑鳍枪兵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.95,0:13:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升其攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力4000。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，你有对抗手段吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.92,0:13:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.85,0:13:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭之流。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这个效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雷枪兵攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}不能{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}发动{\fnYusei Magic}魔法・陷{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}阱卡{\fnYusei Magic}。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法的效果也
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被西尔菲涅无效化了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来她就没有手段防御攻击了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.37,0:14:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《璃绪小姐，冷静一点》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）上吧，黑雷枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击西尔菲涅！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雷光矛！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.31,0:14:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动破灭之流的进一步效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑雷枪兵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.22,0:14:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}对{\fnYusei Magic}手的1{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}张{\fnYusei Magic}魔法・陷{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}阱卡{\fnYusei Magic}！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 凭你根本不是我的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.87,0:14:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚开始决斗的时候也是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都得靠我帮你决定出什么卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然你什么都做不到吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了……才不是呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.55,0:14:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永远……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:14:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永远都 没有凌牙在的话我才不是什么都做不到的我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.57,0:15:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}椭圆冰焰！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？那张卡不是 刚刚被破坏了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 通过被破坏来发动效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}墓地中1只水属性超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 守备力变成零
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次降临吧 希尔菲妮！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 通过这张卡的效果复活的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同时拥有比自身高1级的等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 攻击力是零的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.72,0:15:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《如果 这次抽卡没抽到那张卡的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.41,0:15:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 凌牙对我下一步的……》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 我盖放的那张卡才是真正的盖牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己攻击的时候可能会发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.44,0:16:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你大概是这么想的吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 到底是哪张呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.49,0:16:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！你那样试图预读未来就会产生迷惘。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.75,0:16:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到头来 你什么都没改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不相信自己的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的你不可能抽到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己想要的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）才不是这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐 相信自己！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要相信自己 卡就一定会来。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能因为“万一”什么的就犹豫。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前进吧 向前！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.16,0:16:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 璃绪小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊 就是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.48,0:16:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信自己自己开辟道路！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.35,0:17:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法 冰炎世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让水属性怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.67,0:17:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只当作2只使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希尔菲妮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过椭圆冰炎的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有相同的等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 就有2只等级5的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要向前迈进！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.59,0:17:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级5的希尔菲妮进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以2只份的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.86,0:17:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 冲破那层外壳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）零鸟姬 利奥特·哈耳庇厄！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 发动利奥特·哈耳庇厄的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个叠放单元
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力变成0！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.87,0:18:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}武装冷冻！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.99,0:18:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那只超强力怪兽的攻击被封住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！零鸟姬 璃绪·哈耳庇厄！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动全装甲超量效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将装备的怪兽送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效这次破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）不过伤害你还是得吃下。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.65,0:18:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给鲨鱼造成大伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《铁男：这就是璃绪小姐的进化…》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.83,0:18:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不怕我的盖牌直接攻过来了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成长了啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为　我会这么说吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还差得远呢！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.99,0:18:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤　钻头藤壶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动　装备魔法　超量宝冠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:19:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备给　黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这个效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量怪兽的阶级
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并成为２个超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.09,0:19:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后根据冰火世界的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将钻头藤壶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为２个超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个　和刚才的西尔菲妮一样…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.65,0:19:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用　等级３的钻头藤壶和
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑鳍枪兵　进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.60,0:19:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用４个怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧，海之帝王！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.11,0:19:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}牙鲛帝 鲨鱼·凯撒！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手的场地魔法被巧妙地利用了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不愧是鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼·凯撒 攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.49,0:19:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明攻击力比对手低……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.65,0:19:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动鲨鱼·凯撒的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从原本的叠放单元数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在拥有的叠放单元数量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乘以1000点的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:19:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与原本的叠放单元相差3个。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此攻击力提升3000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.01,0:20:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为自己的场地魔法自取灭亡了啊\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉碎它！鲨鱼·凯撒！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.16,0:20:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯撒·爆裂者！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.85,0:20:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我输了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然很不甘心看来我还差得远呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.59,0:20:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过刚才那次进化我认可了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是突然让游马当你的恋人什么的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让游马当你的恋人？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁说过那种话……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是对铁男说，要跟我决斗的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就得达到游马那个等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我们误会了？骗人的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.19,0:21:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊那是～？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……真是场厉害的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.93,0:21:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天，请和我决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.61,0:21:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.23,0:21:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会变得更强。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.65,0:21:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，如果我赢了的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了的话？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.55,0:21:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，到时候，我再说。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.79,0:21:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很期待哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.59,0:21:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，把误解传遍全校的各位。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.51,0:21:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那边的两位？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（璃绪）能稍微耽误你们一点时间吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.61,0:22:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，说到底兄妹吵架的原因到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟／凯西）不知道也没关系！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.30,0:22:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，完全搞不懂！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.11,0:23:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.82,0:23:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.83,0:23:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.54,0:23:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.80,0:23:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.46,0:23:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.54,0:23:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.39,0:24:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.42,0:24:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.60,0:24:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.73,0:24:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}END

